{"ref":"BDB, קִיצוֹן²","hw":"קִיצוֹן²","html":"† <big>[<span dir=\"rtl\">קִיצוֹן</span>]</big>  <strong>adj. at the end, outermost</strong>;—fs. <span dir=\"rtl\">קִיצֹנָה</span>, of curtain <span dir=\"rtl\">(יְרִיעָה)</span> <a data-ref=\"Exodus 26:4\" href=\"/Exodus.26.4\">Ex 26:4</a>, <a data-ref=\"Exodus 26:10\" href=\"/Exodus.26.10\">10a</a> = <a data-ref=\"Exodus 36:11\" href=\"/Exodus.36.11\">36:11</a>, <a data-ref=\"Exodus 36:17\" href=\"/Exodus.36.17\">17a</a>; ins. also prob. <a data-ref=\"Exodus 26:10\" href=\"/Exodus.26.10\">26:10b</a> = <a data-ref=\"Exodus 36:17\" href=\"/Exodus.36.17\">36:17b</a> so Kit (in Di) Baen.","next":"BDB, קָצֵר","prev":"BDB, קְצִיץ"}